Package: realtek-r8125-optimized-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: realtek-r8125-dkms, r8125-dkms
Description: experimental optimized Realtek RTL8125 driver source for DKMS
 Realtek 9.018-based PCIe Ethernet driver with RSS, multiple transmit queues
 and selected reliability improvements. DKMS builds r8125 for local kernels.
 .
 This package replaces other providers of r8125.ko; differently named packages
 cannot safely install that module together. Hardware validation is required
 before production deployment. Kernel headers and a suitable compiler are
 required for each kernel being built.
